hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1390","Saeed bin Abdul Rahman Al Makhzoumi told us, Sufyan told us, on the authority of Yahya bin Saeed, on the authority of Amra, on the authority of Aisha, and he mentioned The hadith is long in its length about the prayer of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, during the eclipse, and he said in the report: “Then he prostrated and prolonged his prostration, then he rose, then he prostrated, prostrating.” without the first prostration.” Then he mentioned the rest of the hadith."
"1391","On the authority of Sa`id bin Abdul Rahman, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Hisham bin Urwa, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Aisha, the same"
